BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:fx-US-20261028T140000-1@fxcalendar
DTSTAMP:20261029T105950Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261028T135000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261028T141000
SUMMARY:NO TRADE | USD Federal Funds Rate\, FOMC Statement
DESCRIPTION:CATEGORY 1 - DO NOT TRADE\n\nRelease: 2:00 PM ET\nCancel bracke
 t orders. Be 100% flat in NQ\, ES and ZN by 1:50 PM ET.\nDo not trade agai
 n until 2:10 PM ET.\n\nFederal Funds Rate\nWHAT IT IS: The Fed's interest 
 rate decision and statement (quarterly meetings also include the dot plot)
 .\nWHY IT MATTERS: The biggest scheduled event of the cycle. It sets rate 
 expectations for everything\, so ZN\, NQ and ES all move hard.\nForecast 4
 .00%\, Previous 4.00%\n\nFOMC Statement\nWHAT IT IS: The Fed's interest ra
 te decision and statement (quarterly meetings also include the dot plot).\
 nWHY IT MATTERS: The biggest scheduled event of the cycle. It sets rate ex
 pectations for everything\, so ZN\, NQ and ES all move hard.\n\nMoves: ZN\
 , NQ\, ES
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:NO TRADE | USD Federal Funds Rate\, FOMC Statement
TRIGGER:-PT15M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:fx-US-20261028T143000-2@fxcalendar
DTSTAMP:20261029T105950Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261028T142500
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261028T145000
SUMMARY:CAUTION | USD FOMC Press Conference
DESCRIPTION:CATEGORY 2 - PROCEED WITH CAUTION\n\nRelease: 2:30 PM ET\nBe fl
 at from 2:25 PM ET to 2:50 PM ET\, then trade smaller until the move settl
 es.\n\nFOMC Press Conference\nWHAT IT IS: The Fed Chair's press conference
  after the rate decision.\nWHY IT MATTERS: Answers to questions can revers
 e the 2:00 PM move. Stay flat or very small.\n\nMoves: ZN\, NQ\, ES
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:CAUTION | USD FOMC Press Conference
TRIGGER:-PT15M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:fx-US-20261029T083000-1@fxcalendar
DTSTAMP:20261029T105950Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261029T082000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261029T084000
SUMMARY:NO TRADE | USD Advance GDP q/q\, Core PCE Price Index m/m
DESCRIPTION:CATEGORY 1 - DO NOT TRADE\n\nRelease: 8:30 AM ET\nCancel bracke
 t orders. Be 100% flat in NQ\, ES and ZN by 8:20 AM ET.\nDo not trade agai
 n until 8:40 AM ET.\n\nAdvance GDP q/q\nWHAT IT IS: A GDP estimate (econom
 ic growth). The advance estimate matters most\; later ones are revisions.\
 nWHY IT MATTERS: Shows if growth is strong or weak\, which feeds rate expe
 ctations.\nForecast 3.2%\, Previous 1.5%\n\nCore PCE Price Index m/m\nWHAT
  IT IS: PCE inflation\, the Fed's preferred inflation gauge.\nWHY IT MATTE
 RS: Hotter than forecast = yields up (ZN down)\, NQ pressured. Cooler = th
 e reverse.\nForecast 0.3%\, Previous 0.2%\n\nMoves: ES\, NQ\, ZN
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:NO TRADE | USD Advance GDP q/q\, Core PCE Price Index m/m
TRIGGER:-PT15M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:fx-EZ-20261029T091500-2@fxcalendar
DTSTAMP:20261029T105950Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261029T091000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261029T093000
SUMMARY:CAUTION | EUR Main Refinancing Rate\, Monetary Policy Statement
DESCRIPTION:CATEGORY 2 - PROCEED WITH CAUTION\n\nRelease: 9:15 AM ET\nBe fl
 at from 9:10 AM ET to 9:30 AM ET\, then trade smaller until the move settl
 es.\n\nMain Refinancing Rate\nWHAT IT IS: The ECB's interest rate decision
  and statement.\nWHY IT MATTERS: Moves European yields\, which spill into 
 ZN and ES. Matches your 8:10 to 8:30 rule for an 8:15 release.\nForecast 2
 .65%\, Previous 2.65%\n\nMonetary Policy Statement\nWHAT IT IS: The ECB's 
 interest rate decision and statement.\nWHY IT MATTERS: Moves European yiel
 ds\, which spill into ZN and ES. Matches your 8:10 to 8:30 rule for an 8:1
 5 release.\n\nMoves: ZN\, ES
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:CAUTION | EUR Main Refinancing Rate\, Monetary Policy Statement
TRIGGER:-PT15M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:fx-EZ-20261029T094500-2@fxcalendar
DTSTAMP:20261029T105950Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261029T094000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261029T100000
SUMMARY:CAUTION | EUR ECB Press Conference
DESCRIPTION:CATEGORY 2 - PROCEED WITH CAUTION\n\nRelease: 9:45 AM ET\nBe fl
 at from 9:40 AM ET to 10:00 AM ET\, then trade smaller until the move sett
 les.\n\nECB Press Conference\nWHAT IT IS: The ECB President's press confer
 ence after the decision.\nWHY IT MATTERS: Can move markets again about 30 
 minutes after the decision.\n\nMoves: ZN\, ES
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:CAUTION | EUR ECB Press Conference
TRIGGER:-PT15M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:fx-JN-20261029T223000-2@fxcalendar
DTSTAMP:20261029T105950Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261029T220000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261030T000000
SUMMARY:CAUTION | JPY BOJ Policy Rate\, Monetary Policy Statement
DESCRIPTION:CATEGORY 2 - PROCEED WITH CAUTION\n\nRelease: 10:30 PM ET\nBe f
 lat from 10:00 PM ET to 12:00 AM ET\, then trade smaller until the move se
 ttles.\n\nBOJ Policy Rate\nWHAT IT IS: The Bank of Japan's rate decision a
 nd statement (the Outlook Report comes at quarterly meetings).\nWHY IT MAT
 TERS: Lands overnight in ET\, so liquidity is thinner. The exact minute va
 ries\, so the window is wide.\nForecast <1.25%\, Previous <1.25%\n\nMoneta
 ry Policy Statement\nWHAT IT IS: The Bank of Japan's rate decision and sta
 tement (the Outlook Report comes at quarterly meetings).\nWHY IT MATTERS: 
 Lands overnight in ET\, so liquidity is thinner. The exact minute varies\,
  so the window is wide.\n\nMoves: ZN\, NQ
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:CAUTION | JPY BOJ Policy Rate\, Monetary Policy Statement
TRIGGER:-PT15M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
